\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. God of unexampled grace,
\par Redeemer of mankind,
\par Matter of eternal praise 
\par We in Thy passion find:
\par Still our choicest strains we bring, 
\par Still the joyful theme pursue, 
\par Thee the Friend of Sinners sing,
\par Whose love is ever new.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Endless scenes of wonder rise
\par From that mysterious tree,
\par Crucified before our eyes,  
\par Where we our Maker see:
\par Jesus, Lord, what hast thou done?
\par Publish we the death divine, 
\par Stop, and gaze, and fall, and own
\par Has never love like Thine!
\par      
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Never love nor sorrow was 
\par Like that my Saviour showed:
\par See Him stretched on yonder Cross, 
\par And crushed beneath our load!
\par Now discern the Deity,
\par Now His heavenly birth declare! 
\par Faith cries out: 'Tis He 'tis He,
\par My God, that suffers there!
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\f2 
\par }

